From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:00:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Campus doctrines slice 1: charters, Scribe's Tower, Workshop
 doctrines

- BuildingTier.Doctrines/CharterSlots; CycleState.Charters/CharterFillsUsed; Charters service
- Grand Hall charter section (1/2/3 slots, free first fills, refit 60 materials next moon)
- Scribe's Tower building and panel: scrolls and spellglass move here; T2 afield wand recharge; Glasswright (Rare glass, upgrades kept) and Wandwright (rebind wands)
- Enchanter's Workshop T3 becomes a doctrine: Unbinding Floor (Cleanse, blight bonus doubles) or Attunement Forge (rebind staff Innate)
- Round-trip asserts for charters and glass upgrade tiers

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
